    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_19970430.0004\n\nTAIPEI, April 30 , 1997 (AFP)\n\nTaipei shares end 1.2 percent lower\n\n\n\n\nShare prices in Taiwan closed 1.2 percent lower Wednesday due to dwindling buying interest among investors, brokers said.\n\nThe Taiwan Stock Exchange weighted price index fell 106.78 points to 8,485.66.",
